WEBVTT

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:59.380
blocked from the battlefields also with cali 20 and the great

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:11.520
In the streets, in the squares, in the homes,

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:14.220
the vibrant crowd of joy,

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:18.160
festivities of beliefs,

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.250
the arrival of peace.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:23.030
But there were also, in that sea

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:24.590
of porteo enthusiasm,

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:26.910
some islands of indifference,

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:28.880
of incomprehension,

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:29.880
of egoism.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.440
It's my own home.

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:36.680
Ana Maria, look out the window.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:38.460
Did you forget that your boyfriend is here?

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:44.370
He's the one who infected the enthusiasm of that street whore.

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:47.100
I don't know how much you like the noise in our country.

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:50.720
But don't you realize the meaning of this day?

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:57.380
It's one of these four years of horror and nightmare in the world.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:58.500
Oh, nonsense!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.500
I don't think so.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.340
On the contrary.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.040
Argentina has benefited from it.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:04.580
Business.

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:07.410
Dad, how can you talk about business

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.870
when so many millions of men have died unjustly?

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:12.460
For biological reasons, wars are very useful.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:14.320
Periodically, Mother Nature

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.260
performs a purge in humanity.

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:18.920
Otherwise, the subsistence of the planet

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.080
would not be enough for everyone.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:22.800
Precisely, the law of Malthus is based on...

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.380
How comfortable it is to talk here,

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:25.480
away from danger.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:28.070
But if that purge, as you call it,

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:29.070
were to reach the end,

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:29.750
What are you doing?

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:32.910
I want to mourn you and curse mother nature.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:37.410
Girls, do you realize that you are talking to the man who is going to be your husband in a few months?

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:41.210
And if this daughter of ours has not come out, forgive her, Gustavo.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:47.020
Do not worry about me. I know Ana María and I will already know how to contain those liberal squabbles that dominate her.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:50.040
When she is my wife, I will continue to have the same.

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:54.300
Do you understand that the world has changed?

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:57.160
That this war has brought new norms.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.960
That the woman has stopped being a girl and a man.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:02.960
Millions of women have fought for these four years.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:07.960
In the offices, in the factories, in the hospitals, in the battlefields.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.120
We are free!

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:10.680
Ana Maria, what are you saying?

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.060
Those are the readings we have allowed you.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:16.240
The poetry you write, the conferences you listen to.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.480
All that will end soon.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.080
Ana Maria will be a good wife and a good mother.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:23.330
Those dissolving ideas will enter us.

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:27.290
You are wrong if you think you will be a slave to our home.

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.720
When I get married to you, I think of...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.500
all my independence from you.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.480
But what's wrong with you today?

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.460
You're scared, you're bothering me.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.200
You don't consider that I'm sick.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:39.680
It's those songs and those populace songs that attract you.

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:40.960
No, it's not that.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.880
It seems almost shameful to me that we are here,

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:45.740
sitting in this bourgeois commotion,

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:47.950
enthused by the crowd.

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:50.300
I think we should go to them,

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.140
to the populace, as you say,

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:55.490
to celebrate with screams and songs the end of the tragedy.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:56.270
It's crazy.

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:59.290
And we're going to this vulgar tumult.

00:04:59.350 --> 00:04:59.970
And especially...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.120
...without us being interested in the matter.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.120
Without us being interested?

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.070
Well, I am interested.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:08.270
And I'll go out right now to confuse myself with people.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:11.290
To get drunk with screams and songs...

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.070
...and to live the moment that enlivens all of humanity.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:15.570
My daughter, what are you doing?

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:18.490
I order you not to go out, Santa Maria, and on a day like this...

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:19.510
Nothing will happen to me.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.290
I've always known how to take good care of myself.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:23.030
And I also order you not to go out.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:26.210
You have time to order me when I'm a good wife...

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:27.470
...and a good mother by your side.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:28.040
Goodbye.

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.380
I've never seen her like this.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.440
That's the disadvantage of letting a girl go out alone in the afternoon, Lucía.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:41.700
But those studies and the academy, what can I do about it?

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.480
I have the slight suspicion that Ana María doesn't love me.

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:46.690
Don't say that, she adores you.

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:50.490
In addition, her name is in your fortune that tomorrow she will be a deputy, a minister perhaps.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:54.330
Ana María will have her character, but she obeys us all.

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.930
And we have advised her so much.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:59.890
It doesn't matter, she will learn to love me.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:05.560
I'm a man who has a lot of faith in myself, but let's drink the tea without her anyway.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:22.140
You are my husband for anyone.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:23.380
But what's wrong with you?

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:25.740
No, leave me alone, where is your man?

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.160
Well, enough, don't fight.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.920
It is that it gives me indignation that in the whole afternoon I have not...

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:36.660
You see, she messes with everyone and then she wants me to kick her.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:39.500
But who do you think you're married to, a carpenter?

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:44.700
Oh, what a disgrace! I like handsome, brave men who want to kill for a woman.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.550
I came to touch this dead man.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:49.050
Don't exaggerate, Nelly. I see you're quite handsome.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:52.520
Remember the other night when you made a fight with that English sailor?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:54.840
That's how that beast left my face.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.400
And without reason, because the guy didn't even look at her.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.970
And last month in El Pigal when he provoked the...

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:05.040
When you have a woman like me, you have to make her respect you.

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.920
Letting her break your face for ideas is an honor.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.260
But what a pleasure to see you always hurt me.

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:12.190
You're so handsome, how many times do you want me to tell you?

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:13.150
You're crazy, I know it.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.590
Whatever you want, from today I'll get out of your trouble.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.840
Besides, we're fighting in the armistice and I don't want to fight.

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:19.800
It's long.

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:21.920
Well, well, we've already fought all day, huh?

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.020
It's 7 o'clock, we'll take a car and go home.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:26.880
Are you crazy? I don't eat or sleep today.

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.840
We're done with the war.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:29.700
It's long.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.800
Don't drink any more! We have a match tonight at Alberto's house and you're not even going to see the Knights.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.880
What match? My match? It's not even played yet.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.540
The armistice is being held. Give me the bottle.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:38.240
I'm not giving you anything.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.300
Actually, we could suspend the match. Goodbye.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:41.200
I'm tired.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:44.240
You know what, David? The Tucumano's money is over.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:47.400
And this night, it's a notary who sent me to do it.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.360
It won't appear today.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.350
Besides, I'm quite bored, you know.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.300
When you say that I even want to work.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:54.510
Work, you? With your name?

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.710
And with those hands that God made for poker?

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:57.870
You're delirious.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.880
What Alberto needs is...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.380
He fought with the French Loulou and now he's all alone.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:04.680
He's even lost his ability.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:09.160
The other day he gave me a poker of aces and the candidate a real ladder.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:12.090
Maybe you're right. I'm a little lonely.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.740
I'm bored of easy love, of a woman who's a burden, I don't know.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:17.140
What's wrong?

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:18.680
It looks like you're bothering someone.

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.410
A movie, come on!

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:21.630
No, no, I don't want a movie.

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:22.810
Don't you think it's a woman from your mother?

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:23.790
Let's see.

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:24.590
But I...

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:25.030
But I...

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:33.940
Calm down, gentlemen.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.620
Don't worry, he's going to feel it.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:36.380
He's going to start hitting you.

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:37.920
But do you want me to kill myself?

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.320
Just go, miss, go.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:41.980
I love you, my friend.

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.840
I love you.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:24.620
Are you happy for today?

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:26.480
I thank you so much for your hospitality.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:27.300
Oh, it doesn't matter.

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:29.890
Thank you for the armistice and for that...

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.570
Drunkards who made me meet her.

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:32.530
Drink, drink.

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:34.730
I drank two glasses and I'm not drunk.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:38.580
But you still haven't told us who you are and what you were doing there alone on the street.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:44.330
I am, even if you don't believe it, a bourgeois girl about to marry a very serious man.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.550
Who you probably don't want.

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:48.440
What's the point of talking about that?

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.090
Oh, but I have to go, it's more than eight and my parents...

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:53.330
Forget about your parents, Mica.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:54.330
They're waiting for me.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.690
They're waiting for you, they're waiting for you. What's wrong with that?

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:59.730
I've been out of my house for five years, they sent a letter and they're still waiting for me.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.680
It's because you married me, Prenda.

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:03.320
That's why I haven't come back. It's a shame.

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:07.060
You're crazy to smoke in a cafe and the people.

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.880
What does it have to do with me? In Europe, women now smoke even on the street.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:11.060
Finish that drink.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:12.640
I hope it doesn't hurt me.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:13.580
The last one.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:14.840
Well, what did you say?

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.380
Ana María says her name.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:17.280
Nice name.

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:20.430
The friends of the academy call me Minguella.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:23.380
They say I recite the verses of Mistral well.

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:25.440
Mistral? The one who won the last empanero this Sunday?

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:26.620
Don't be rude.

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:28.720
He won the previous Sunday.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.580
That I have a weakness for poetry.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.340
And I'm going to do this.

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:35.960
Mireia, how beautiful.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:39.100
So we will also call her from today.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.250
A toast for Mireia the unknown.

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.910
What do you think if we invite her to dinner with us in Armenonville, Alberto?

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:47.310
In Armenonville, no.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.590
That you always mess with me there.

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:50.490
For me it would be a happiness if you accepted.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.430
You are so crazy.

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:53.430
I can't eat out of the house.

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:54.750
Are you afraid of your boyfriend?

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:57.300
My boyfriend, my parents and the people.

00:10:57.560 --> 00:10:58.620
What would you say about me?

00:10:59.420 --> 00:10:59.860
Let's go.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.500
Don't be silly. Drink another glass, my friend.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:04.390
Well, but the last one, huh?

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:05.610
After that, I'm leaving.

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:07.660
I see you were right, my dear boy.

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:09.140
And is that bad?

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:14.210
No, but when you love poets, as you say, it is more than enough.

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:15.810
Another night I will accept the invitation.

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:17.520
Today I feel dizzy.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:20.540
Besides, this afternoon I will discuss with my father, with my boyfriend.

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:21.420
A reason for more.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:24.280
Think that I have met you today, a day of universal reconciliation.

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.240
That maybe we will not meet again.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:29.600
But how do I justify my arrival at this hour?

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:34.590
What do you think if I call your house saying that you're staying to eat with a studio partner?

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.630
Don't start to mess things up!

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:37.090
Shut up!

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:38.630
But you're going to ruin it.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:40.110
No, no, I can't.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:41.830
Leave it, they don't see that you don't want to.

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.190
Maybe you don't trust us.

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:45.800
You barely know us and it's natural that you're afraid.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:46.830
That's not it.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.500
I've never been homo-gigantic.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:49.860
And my parents know it well.

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:52.020
That's where all our arguments come from.

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:55.370
Besides, you don't take people, you've proven it.

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:57.530
Why do you want to hurt me?

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:59.820
Oh no, with us you can go out quietly.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.500
Yes, you're going to have fun and we'll take you to bed early.

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:06.780
That's right. We'll drink the rumenombil, we'll listen to some tangos and go home.

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:11.880
I don't like to lie. This is the house number. I don't dare to talk.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.160
Tell my parents where we're going and if they give me permission.

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:18.040
Don't worry, as soon as I tell them, I'll leave them covered in wax.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:20.220
You don't know the lip I have for these things.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:21.200
Come with me to the telephone.

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.420
But why are you taking me to the toilet?

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:22.620
You don't have to.

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:33.170
Do you think your father did it?

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:34.640
I don't think so.

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.340
It would be the first time.

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:39.680
And I'm sorry, because tonight I feel like another woman.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.590
Yes, yes, well, yes.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.030
Oh, what a mess!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.390
What happened, Lely?

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.030
I spoke to a lady who must be the mother.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:48.970
As soon as I told her that we were going to Armenonville, she fainted.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.310
Then he passed the tube to an old man who must be the son-in-law.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:52.050
And what did he say?

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:54.370
He yelled at me to send a midwife to the girl's house.

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:55.570
And will we have to send her?

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:56.990
Look, Alberto needs company.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.550
Let's say that everything is arranged.

00:12:58.690 --> 00:12:59.390
Your father-in-law believes it.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:01.810
But what about tonight, when I come back to your house?

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.290
And what's going to happen to her? She's nothing.

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:06.610
Besides, this is a time when women must be free, Che.

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:08.690
Look, let's tell her that her parents love her so much.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.280
Careful, Nelly, because in the end I'm going to pay for it.

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:13.190
I'm going to pay for it.

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:15.100
Cheers.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.360
For Ana Maria.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.440
No, for Mireya.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.500
Didn't I tell you you were going to have fun with the others?

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:34.840
Serve her another cup of tea.

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:35.180
No, no.

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:36.000
Enough for today.

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.480
I'm going to be late for midnight.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:38.620
Take me home.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:39.560
A little while more.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:40.260
And good.

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:41.900
Of course I will.

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:00.430
Dance.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:01.930
I'm so tired.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.550
Besides, I dance very badly.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:04.210
It's the farewell.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:05.690
I'll teach you the tango.

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:06.210
Dance.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.050
Don't be shy.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.130
If tango is in fashion, it's the best society.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.930
Besides, with a handsome man like Alberto.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:13.350
And if I had to dance like me with this mequetrete.

