00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:14.660
More hygienic, he says.

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:17.660
Do you understand, dad?

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:20.250
It's mine, and it seems that I can't do it.

00:22:20.550 --> 00:22:23.810
If God gives me strength, I have to repair the mistake I made with you,

00:22:23.950 --> 00:22:26.380
that you will legally separate from that man.

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:28.430
Wait for you to be very strong,

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:29.890
for your daughter to have some...

