Well, girls, now I say goodbye for a moment.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:01.960
because I have to call home again.

00:26:02.040 --> 00:26:04.080
I already sent my lady to warn you about the mucama.

00:26:04.220 --> 00:26:04.720
Leave me alone!

00:26:05.180 --> 00:26:08.040
No, no, no, stay with my lady, I have to talk to her.

00:26:15.990 --> 00:26:16.750
Please, 4727.

00:26:19.750 --> 00:26:21.200
Margot! Don't be crazy, Margot!

00:26:21.360 --> 00:26:22.380
Don't be crazy, Margot!

00:26:23.100 --> 00:26:23.480
Maria!

00:26:31.560 --> 00:26:32.220
