00:26:44.790 --> 00:26:48.280
Don't bother, ma'am! The woman must be sleeping by now!

00:26:48.540 --> 00:26:50.180
What have you done?

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:07.580
You're going to get angry now, little boy.

00:27:08.460 --> 00:27:10.800
Come on, come on, have a drink and everything will be over.

00:27:11.200 --> 00:27:12.280
Come on, sit down.

00:27:12.560 --> 00:27:14.040
