00:28:23.140 --> 00:28:25.340
Because I'm the son of Dr. Medina, ma'am.

00:28:25.680 --> 00:28:27.850
I'm very happy to know that.

00:28:28.030 --> 00:28:29.200
Do you work here with him?

00:28:29.520 --> 00:28:29.860
For now.

00:28:33.120 --> 00:28:38.340
No, ma'am. My vocation is medicine.

00:28:38.800 --> 00:28:41.210
That's a good idea. I'm happy to hear it.

00:28:41.210 --> 00:28:43.330
But going back to Mr. Peña, did you know him, ma'am?

00:28:43.450 --> 00:28:44.780
He was my father.

00:28:45.190 --> 00:28:47.270
But then, forgive me, I'll call you back.

00:28:47.550 --> 00:28:48.720
What are you doing with that patient?

00:28:49.280 --> 00:28:50.360
It's a police case.

00:28:50.560 --> 00:28:52.500
No, no, no, please. I don't have a cure.

00:28:52.720 --> 00:28:56.940
From now on, my friend Torres, this is the last time I intervene in your business.

00:28:57.900 --> 00:28:59.280
Now, because I'm very much a friend of yours.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:03.590
Believe me, in this case, that man's complaint is...

00:29:03.590 --> 00:29:04.870
Yes, I know what you're going to tell me.

00:29:05.010 --> 00:29:07.270
That he's unfaithful, that they were playing clean,

00:29:07.710 --> 00:29:09.540
that the man lost because he wanted to.

00:29:09.640 --> 00:29:10.540
He was hit in the ass.

00:29:10.780 --> 00:29:14.140
Doctor, the guy came to the house to run away with money.

00:29:14.360 --> 00:29:14.700
And we...

00:29:15.280 --> 00:29:16.440
Well, everything is already settled.

00:29:17.130 --> 00:29:19.730
The money has been returned to him and the man has withdrawn the complaint.

00:29:20.640 --> 00:29:23.740
But you know, Torres, it's the last time I intervene in a case like this.

00:29:23.900 --> 00:29:24.380
Thank you very much.

00:29:24.500 --> 00:29:27.210
I assure you that I will try to correct you.

00:29:27.740 --> 00:29:28.300
I'm telling you honestly.

00:29:28.500 --> 00:29:29.890
It's a shame.

00:29:31.690 --> 00:29:33.990
We'll have to be more careful to choose the points, doctor.

00:29:34.210 --> 00:29:37.370
I warned you that the guy looked like he was alive, but you didn't want to listen to me.

00:29:37.500 --> 00:29:39.300
What happened in the front, sir? An accident?

00:29:39.720 --> 00:29:43.040
Nothing. I had to pull his face out of the closet and...

00:29:43.040 --> 00:29:43.880
And he almost got his face out.

00:29:44.270 --> 00:29:45.610
As for your honors, doctor...

00:29:45.610 --> 00:29:48.580
Let's not talk about that. I've intervened for your family, I've already told you.

00:29:48.870 --> 00:29:50.900
Good afternoon and thank you very much. Let's go.

00:29:51.040 --> 00:29:55.080
Would you like me to recommend all my friends who are in the field?

00:29:55.220 --> 00:29:55.900
Enough, Nelly.

00:29:56.080 --> 00:29:57.340
Very good, doctor.

00:30:01.440 --> 00:30:02.660
Call the doctor, huh?

00:30:02.840 --> 00:30:05.870
You saved us from a good one.

00:30:06.070 --> 00:30:08.530
Well, from today on, live quietly and stop fooling around.

00:30:08.650 --> 00:30:09.440
It can happen.

00:30:13.160 --> 00:30:18.160
What do you mean, my dear?

00:30:18.790 --> 00:30:19.370
Of course!

00:30:19.930 --> 00:30:20.830
It was that night.

00:30:21.230 --> 00:30:23.230
You woke up a few years ago in the almenoville.

00:30:23.430 --> 00:30:27.020
And although a little late, I want to clarify a matter with her.

00:30:27.760 --> 00:30:28.400
Wait outside, please.

00:30:28.700 --> 00:30:28.780
Yes.

00:30:29.050 --> 00:30:29.530
Let's go, Nelly.

00:30:30.320 --> 00:30:31.440
Let's see when you get old, huh?

00:30:31.480 --> 00:30:32.840
We'll go out to dance one night, do you want?

00:30:33.180 --> 00:30:33.840
Come on!

00:30:33.980 --> 00:30:34.900
It's a dream, see?

00:30:35.080 --> 00:30:43.700
All these years I've been nailed to a stick.

00:30:43.940 --> 00:30:46.480
They were miserable here.

00:30:58.220 --> 00:30:58.520
Bad man.

00:30:59.510 --> 00:30:59.970
However, believe me,

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:11.480
Tell me that most of my mistakes could have been avoided by you, if I had not known you, or if knowing you had helped me with your affection.

00:31:11.660 --> 00:31:14.150
You are so humiliated with what you believe in.

00:31:14.230 --> 00:31:17.300
I knew you.

00:31:17.520 --> 00:31:28.110
But it also made me understand that you were wrong and that you are very happy.

00:31:30.190 --> 00:31:31.130
I was wrong, unfortunately.

00:31:31.770 --> 00:31:34.660
If I had believed that night in its sincerity,

00:31:34.960 --> 00:31:37.480
perhaps my life would also be different.

00:31:38.360 --> 00:31:40.540
It's just that fate was against us that night.

00:31:40.840 --> 00:31:43.290
But now it's too late to remember.

00:31:51.420 --> 00:31:57.100
But now it occurs to me,

00:31:57.140 --> 00:31:59.960
does this visit to a lawyer relate to...

00:32:00.320 --> 00:32:06.900
With his heritage, he has reached so many, he has reached so many,

00:32:06.900 --> 00:32:13.400
I know something about his life, a daughter, to whom they are teaching to hate me,

00:32:13.400 --> 00:32:24.200
I am a man of honor, I am a player, a man without will,

00:32:24.560 --> 00:32:27.690
I have lost a fortune and I do not know how to earn a living working.

00:32:31.080 --> 00:32:35.150
Parasyte, understand, you will see God.

00:32:36.400 --> 00:32:49.200
And why, Mother Teresita, am I more important than my husband and my mother?

00:32:54.950 --> 00:32:55.130
God.

00:33:01.400 --> 00:33:04.340
Please, I want to give this card to this lady when I leave.

00:33:04.440 --> 00:33:06.130
I will be very grateful.

00:33:06.250 --> 00:33:06.370
Okay.

00:33:07.050 --> 00:33:12.970
You must be sure that I will not agree to that divorce that your lawyer Medina proposes to me.

00:33:12.990 --> 00:33:14.760
You will continue to unite me even if you do not want to.

00:33:14.840 --> 00:33:15.800
You have no right.

00:33:16.100 --> 00:33:18.000
You are humiliating yourself in front of everyone.

00:33:18.480 --> 00:33:20.120
The law is perfect.

00:33:20.400 --> 00:33:21.700
As a lawyer I know the laws.

00:33:21.960 --> 00:33:23.960
You are my wife and you must obey me.

00:33:24.100 --> 00:33:27.220
I am a public man and I do not want scandals or divorces.

00:33:28.180 --> 00:33:29.860
Even if you face me out there with a jersey.

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:33.670
And you know I'm not saying this for myself, but for our daughter.

00:33:33.870 --> 00:33:36.920
I'll know how to take care of my daughter, and so you don't worry about her,

00:33:37.140 --> 00:33:40.660
I'll tell her I'll put her in a school where you can't talk bad about her father.

00:33:41.340 --> 00:33:43.060
Me, talking bad about you?

00:33:43.280 --> 00:33:46.240
Do you think I'm capable of committing your own villainy?

00:33:46.360 --> 00:33:47.560
I think you're capable of everything,

00:33:47.920 --> 00:33:50.740
since you went to report our intimate matters to a lawyer.

00:33:51.320 --> 00:33:52.680
So you don't accept the separation?

00:33:53.240 --> 00:33:53.660
No.

00:33:54.050 --> 00:33:55.650
And you're thinking of getting away from my daughter?

00:33:55.770 --> 00:33:56.390
You've already heard him.

00:33:56.510 --> 00:33:59.270
I want to warn you that no matter what happens, you'll be responsible.

00:34:00.190 --> 00:34:02.650
I am always responsible for my actions, and we have finished.

00:34:03.050 --> 00:34:05.660
And today our life will change completely.

00:34:05.980 --> 00:34:08.800
On the street we will be husband and wife, for my position.

00:34:09.100 --> 00:34:10.790
But in here we will be two strangers.

00:34:12.160 --> 00:34:15.780
Doctor, but let me educate my daughter, at least.

00:34:16.420 --> 00:34:18.920
Educate her? As your parents educated you here.

00:34:18.940 --> 00:34:23.560
You will go to a school where you can see her once a month and in my presence.

00:34:58.190 --> 00:34:59.550
I know you recognized Mireia at that time.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:01.980
Look if your husband becomes a good guy.

00:35:02.120 --> 00:35:03.240
The happiness that you lost.

00:35:03.940 --> 00:35:06.240
Please, Nelly, a little more prudence.

00:35:06.470 --> 00:35:08.130
I know I didn't say it out of malice.

00:35:08.270 --> 00:35:09.130
You shouldn't talk like that.

00:35:09.660 --> 00:35:11.660
Well, if it bothers you, I'll go.

00:35:12.100 --> 00:35:13.510
Come on, I want to drink tea.

00:35:13.590 --> 00:35:14.890
Come on, I don't feel like it.

00:35:15.140 --> 00:35:18.880
And maybe you throw a throw with me.

00:35:19.200 --> 00:35:21.290
I'll send you to dress up as the bathhouse of Max Zeller.

00:35:21.390 --> 00:35:22.600
No, if he does it on purpose.

00:35:23.040 --> 00:35:25.060
They will see that one day I will be cascading all over the crew.

00:35:25.540 --> 00:35:26.130
Come on.

00:35:26.150 --> 00:35:29.890
I never thought you would pay.

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:32.580
I don't know how to tell you.

00:35:33.470 --> 00:35:35.510
I'm the happiest man in the world with you.

00:35:35.510 --> 00:35:37.400
I think of your things.

00:35:37.680 --> 00:35:40.620
I don't want to forget the past.

00:35:40.960 --> 00:35:42.120
I don't have a past.

00:35:42.480 --> 00:35:43.680
I'm starting to live now.

00:35:44.080 --> 00:35:47.510
As you thought when you lived with my husband Victor Escándalo.

00:35:47.550 --> 00:35:49.370
He told everyone that I was sick in the hospital.

00:35:54.920 --> 00:35:55.440
I don't remember it.

00:35:55.840 --> 00:35:59.220
Do you think that one day I will remember to show our affection?

00:35:59.670 --> 00:35:59.770
No.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:03.310
I adore her, but I know she doesn't love me anymore.

00:36:03.410 --> 00:36:05.160
I only trust you.

00:36:05.500 --> 00:36:07.380
Thank you for the faith you have in me, Grecia.

00:36:07.560 --> 00:36:10.430
But you're so sure of me.

00:36:10.590 --> 00:36:11.840
As of my life.

00:36:12.830 --> 00:36:13.530
That cheers me up.

00:36:13.530 --> 00:36:15.300
I thought I was a useless being.

00:36:16.260 --> 00:36:18.600
I'm willing to change my life for the better.

00:36:19.780 --> 00:36:21.640
If I run out of money, we'll go back to Buenos Aires and work.

00:36:22.390 --> 00:36:23.250
I'll fight for you.

00:36:23.370 --> 00:36:27.460
We're going to Lloveras.

00:36:27.550 --> 00:36:27.870
Let's go.

00:36:28.630 --> 00:36:29.630
We're going to Lloveras!

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:32.600
What did he tell you that I looked at your leg?

00:36:33.320 --> 00:36:34.040
She lied!

00:36:34.400 --> 00:36:35.180
Sir, you looked at me!

00:36:35.420 --> 00:36:36.280
I look at the crap!

00:36:36.820 --> 00:36:38.600
Crap? My leg with crap?

00:36:38.960 --> 00:36:40.540
Listen, I was going to hit him with a bullet!

00:36:45.970 --> 00:36:47.810
But what's going on here?

00:36:47.930 --> 00:36:51.750
As usual, if life was for me and if life wasn't for me,

00:36:51.790 --> 00:36:53.370
I can't stand this life anymore!

00:36:53.390 --> 00:36:54.570
I throw myself from head to toe!

00:36:56.920 --> 00:36:58.840
He's going to throw himself!

00:37:00.350 --> 00:37:01.010
Don't you want me to go?

00:37:01.330 --> 00:37:04.910
Nothing. Now I'm going to take you.

00:37:05.110 --> 00:37:05.710
I didn't tell you!

00:37:09.180 --> 00:37:14.120
Those were months of investment, of whirlwind, of happiness,

00:37:14.500 --> 00:37:17.780
filled only by the memory of my daughter.

00:37:18.280 --> 00:37:20.500
Alberto, with his unwavering kindness,

00:37:20.860 --> 00:37:25.120
tried by all means to make lighter the load of my thoughts,

00:37:25.660 --> 00:37:29.610
but fate reserved me new misfortunes.

00:37:33.100 --> 00:37:49.360
What the hell are we doing here in Paris, girls?

00:37:49.580 --> 00:37:51.200
Calm down, they're going to kick us out of the hotel.

00:37:51.280 --> 00:37:54.680
We better go somewhere else, for that we're going to have a lot of money.

00:37:54.920 --> 00:37:55.380
Let's sing.

00:37:55.680 --> 00:37:59.200
What the hell are we doing here in Paris, girls?

00:38:00.030 --> 00:38:01.330
Let's go to sleep. Come to my room.

00:38:01.570 --> 00:38:02.470
No, leave me alone. I'm drunk.

00:38:02.650 --> 00:38:03.430
Come on!

00:38:03.610 --> 00:38:04.050
Come on!

00:38:04.050 --> 00:38:05.390
Come on, Cristina!

00:38:05.960 --> 00:38:07.580
Come on, Cristina!

00:38:07.820 --> 00:38:09.870
Come on, Cristina!

00:38:10.050 --> 00:38:10.630
Come on!

00:38:10.810 --> 00:38:13.080
Brother, I'm drunk, but I'm not.

00:38:13.400 --> 00:38:14.440
I have to talk to you, you know?

00:38:14.620 --> 00:38:14.880
About what?

00:38:15.020 --> 00:38:17.790
Do you know who we find in the boulevard today, me and Nelly?

00:38:18.040 --> 00:38:18.280
Who?

00:38:18.520 --> 00:38:20.500
The Fiorito brothers and the Basco Arzaba.

00:38:20.640 --> 00:38:21.360
Those beggars!

00:38:21.760 --> 00:38:23.250
Please, you haven't talked to them about me.

00:38:23.430 --> 00:38:25.790
They asked me about you and they already knew you were in Paris.

00:38:25.970 --> 00:38:28.130
I told you I don't want to go back to the Andes, Chodera.

00:38:28.250 --> 00:38:29.670
I turn out to be changing my life.

00:38:30.060 --> 00:38:30.880
Break with the past.

00:38:31.140 --> 00:38:33.060
You're sitting here, what are you going to do?

00:38:33.220 --> 00:38:35.520
I don't know. Go back to Buenos Aires.

00:38:36.330 --> 00:38:36.950
Har, we'll see.

00:38:37.190 --> 00:38:38.010
We won't see anything.

00:38:38.620 --> 00:38:40.560
You've thrown a woman on top and you have to keep her.

00:38:41.030 --> 00:38:42.530
You're not going to let her die, damn it.

00:38:42.860 --> 00:38:44.020
And you're not going to serve to work.

00:38:44.360 --> 00:38:45.710
I don't want to know anything, do you understand?

00:38:45.990 --> 00:38:46.910
Tell me, Saje.

00:38:47.050 --> 00:38:48.830
If I get in for Mireya, I'll tell you.

00:38:48.930 --> 00:38:52.090
Well, you can do whatever you want, but I have to transmit what they told me to you.

00:38:52.290 --> 00:38:52.990
What are you talking about?

00:38:53.610 --> 00:38:54.450
Useless, but talk about it once.

00:38:54.630 --> 00:38:59.970
Look, it seems that they have caught a junkie who has a lot of dollars and wants to present...

00:39:01.230 --> 00:39:03.430
Listen to me until the end, before Miguel comes out.

00:39:03.790 --> 00:39:04.530
I'll bring the next one.

00:39:05.540 --> 00:39:07.970
Leave the mirror and go to bed.

00:39:08.190 --> 00:39:08.690
I'm leaving.

00:39:09.670 --> 00:39:09.990
Wait!

00:39:10.470 --> 00:39:13.130
If I saw you talking about Alberto, I'd give you a kiss.

00:39:13.710 --> 00:39:14.330
What kiss?

00:39:14.870 --> 00:39:17.160
To have a...

00:39:21.930 --> 00:39:22.510
Plata speaks to me.

00:39:22.910 --> 00:39:24.240
We don't lack anything.

00:39:24.500 --> 00:39:26.340
We live in the air.

00:39:26.620 --> 00:39:29.510
Or maybe you don't know that Alberto got drunk with you until the last penny.

00:39:30.920 --> 00:39:36.450
Alberto, Nelly, please, I want you to make it clear, what's going on?

00:39:36.510 --> 00:39:38.150
Oh, if you don't come, I swear I'll turn on the light!

00:39:38.610 --> 00:39:40.020
What are you talking about? I'm telling you!

00:39:40.220 --> 00:39:45.000
Yes! It's great to be a lady and live six months in Paris at all luxuries!

00:39:45.060 --> 00:39:46.760
You don't have to think about making a living, friend!

00:39:47.160 --> 00:39:51.380
Are you going to propose to Alberto to do what he did again?

00:39:51.380 --> 00:39:54.290
It's the only skill he has, why won't he take advantage of it?

00:39:54.450 --> 00:39:57.010
Oh, if you think you're the lady of the society, of course!

00:39:57.330 --> 00:39:59.970
Enough! You're giving me a hard time!

00:40:00.090 --> 00:40:02.120
So disgusting, so disgusting!

00:40:03.040 --> 00:40:03.340
What disgusting?

00:40:04.720 --> 00:40:06.640
There is no danger of living.

00:40:07.060 --> 00:40:09.260
Look, looking for parties.

00:40:09.740 --> 00:40:10.940
Tomorrow we talk to the boys.

00:40:11.180 --> 00:40:13.820
But Vera, please go to your dormitory.

00:40:13.900 --> 00:40:14.960
I have to talk to Alberto.

00:40:15.320 --> 00:40:16.000
Yes, of course.

00:40:17.060 --> 00:40:17.700
See you tomorrow.

00:40:18.150 --> 00:40:18.730
Speak no more.

00:40:19.910 --> 00:40:20.350
Alberto.

00:40:30.440 --> 00:40:32.440
What was your friend proposing to you?

00:40:32.460 --> 00:40:35.790
Me? Nothing. We're talking business.

00:40:36.570 --> 00:40:39.530
Business beyond decency. Isn't that right?

00:40:40.050 --> 00:40:41.850
Mireya, how can you believe that?

00:40:42.390 --> 00:40:42.990
Listen to me, Alberto.

00:40:43.290 --> 00:40:46.070
I just found out that you're without money.

00:40:46.290 --> 00:40:49.070
But remember what you promised me one day without coming to this case.

00:40:49.230 --> 00:40:50.990
To work, to be a good man.

00:40:51.320 --> 00:40:52.700
I don't want to lie to you, Mireya.

00:40:53.200 --> 00:40:55.480
It's true that you sent Lloveras to propose something to me.

00:40:55.730 --> 00:40:57.520
But he's not to blame. It's an unconscious.

00:40:58.440 --> 00:40:59.980
But you're not, and you don't accept it.

00:41:03.080 --> 00:41:07.790
I don't want to swear at you, but I think of you and the luxury you're used to.

00:41:08.070 --> 00:41:12.180
I don't need luxury by your side. I'll work for you if it's necessary.

00:41:12.500 --> 00:41:15.140
But I do need it. It's useless that you try to deceive me.

00:41:15.420 --> 00:41:18.370
We're in misery and there's an opportunity to redo it.

00:41:18.450 --> 00:41:21.020
You can't go back to Buenos Aires for a few years and here.

00:41:21.340 --> 00:41:22.890
What kind of work can I start?

00:41:23.440 --> 00:41:24.520
You'll find something.

00:41:24.820 --> 00:41:26.320
Besides, it's not about cheating anyone.

00:41:26.540 --> 00:41:28.890
I'm a natural player. I have luck and courage.

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:31.100
I don't want to lose money without using dirty tricks.

00:41:31.440 --> 00:41:33.990
I see that you have it all decided.

00:41:34.350 --> 00:41:35.620
I do it for you.

00:41:35.880 --> 00:41:38.620
I could see you in misery and lose you.

00:41:38.860 --> 00:41:43.990
Give me this last chance.

00:41:44.330 --> 00:41:46.230
I will lose to play in life.

00:41:46.680 --> 00:41:48.320
And how could I stop you?

00:41:48.360 --> 00:41:49.320
Who am I?

00:41:49.840 --> 00:41:51.260
I left everything to follow.

00:41:51.500 --> 00:41:55.460
A woman without family, without friends, without means of life.

00:41:55.660 --> 00:41:58.380
And I could abandon you even if I wanted to.

00:41:58.660 --> 00:41:59.540
You will never abandon me.

00:42:00.990 --> 00:42:03.480
Since now we are united forever.

00:42:03.900 --> 00:42:05.360
The good ones.

00:42:06.490 --> 00:42:16.670
I lived a life without control of those around me.

00:42:16.710 --> 00:42:20.060
I was, like them, a being without willpower.

00:42:36.240 --> 00:42:40.300
One night and a good poker game.

00:42:45.500 --> 00:42:47.260
You were great tonight, Alberto.

00:42:47.520 --> 00:42:48.560
What a way to play, huh?

00:42:48.720 --> 00:42:49.550
A bit of luck.

00:42:50.990 --> 00:42:53.590
You know how to help luck very well.

00:42:53.590 --> 00:42:54.770
You've already drunk a lot, Mireia.

00:42:55.100 --> 00:42:55.900
Leave me alone.

00:42:56.560 --> 00:42:59.040
Fourteen hours of poker, holding on to weird people.

00:42:59.140 --> 00:42:59.560
That's why.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:01.400
I don't have time.

00:43:01.740 --> 00:43:03.600
Remember that tomorrow we'll travel to Persia again.

00:43:03.960 --> 00:43:06.000
Yes, because here in Vienna we are already very well-known.

00:43:06.300 --> 00:43:09.130
Five years of trains, of vapors, of planes.

00:43:09.510 --> 00:43:12.200
When will we rest a little?

00:43:12.560 --> 00:43:15.280
As soon as we make a good move, we'll leave all this and live quietly.

00:43:16.310 --> 00:43:20.420
Yes, if we make a good move, we'll spend the money and start over.

00:43:20.780 --> 00:43:21.740
I know it from memory.

00:43:22.080 --> 00:43:23.880
We can't go back to Buenos Aires for your things.

00:43:24.140 --> 00:43:26.430
If you had divorced and married Alberto ...

00:43:26.430 --> 00:43:27.970
Let's not talk about those things, please.

00:43:28.370 --> 00:43:29.850
I know what my destiny is and I accept it.

00:43:30.190 --> 00:43:31.550
How are you tonight, Mireya?

00:43:31.710 --> 00:43:33.070
A little bitter, as always.

00:43:33.290 --> 00:43:33.730
Keep talking.

00:43:34.270 --> 00:43:35.010
Bitter, no.

00:43:35.890 --> 00:43:36.290
Resignated.

00:43:37.180 --> 00:43:40.960
The only thing that comforts me is to think that I was not to blame for what happened to me.

00:43:41.040 --> 00:43:43.680
Well, if you stop with your philosophy, we're going to fix the tubs for tomorrow.

00:43:44.020 --> 00:43:45.600
What time is it?

00:43:46.200 --> 00:43:46.960
April, Vera.

00:43:47.200 --> 00:43:57.840
We celebrate for Mireya.

00:43:57.960 --> 00:43:59.830
I can remember you in my dreams.

00:44:00.124 --> 00:44:01.124
Hey!

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:33.060
Of course, you left your good asses! How lucky you are!

00:44:33.420 --> 00:44:33.620
Nelly!

00:44:33.760 --> 00:44:37.170
No, it's not about that. I care about the money.

00:44:37.530 --> 00:44:41.970
Now you're alone and I can recover it.

00:44:42.370 --> 00:44:45.600
Conquer your love. It's my only option.

00:44:46.160 --> 00:44:50.460
Of course, now that you're a widow, you get together with your daughter, you get married with this one and having money!

00:44:50.780 --> 00:44:51.120
Of course.

00:44:51.360 --> 00:44:53.460
I would have married Mireia knowing the truth.

00:44:54.720 --> 00:44:59.980
Now, you'll see. I gave tomorrow four tickets to Buenos Aires in the first bus.

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:03.010
Don't listen to him. We'll convince him later.

00:45:03.090 --> 00:45:04.030
Shall we prepare the chests?

00:45:04.290 --> 00:45:06.440
No, Mariana.

00:45:07.080 --> 00:45:09.080
Now I want to think about my daughter.

00:45:09.650 --> 00:45:13.330
Look, now she's ten years old.

00:45:13.450 --> 00:45:19.370
How beautiful she is, as I imagine her.

00:45:19.390 --> 00:45:22.640
Give her her father's advice.

00:45:22.960 --> 00:45:25.160
But no, no.

00:45:25.770 --> 00:45:27.030
She has my blood.

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:33.860
My God, I can't give up.

00:46:00.640 --> 00:46:04.000
Besides, I want to meet her first, to see how she reacts,

00:46:04.360 --> 00:46:06.930
to see if she speaks the voice of the blood.

00:46:07.250 --> 00:46:11.020
Nonsense! She's your daughter and you have all the rights over her.

00:46:11.480 --> 00:46:13.180
I'm not interested in legal rights.

00:46:13.260 --> 00:46:15.440
I want to know your trust.

00:46:15.820 --> 00:46:19.400
What would you have said about me, your father, and your mother?

00:46:20.060 --> 00:46:21.800
Don't get excited about that, ma'am.

00:46:21.880 --> 00:46:24.230
I met Robles and I know what he was like.

00:46:25.540 --> 00:46:26.100
There's the camera.

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:30.880
I want to talk to you, Lucia.

00:46:31.000 --> 00:46:32.340
Hello, ma'am.

00:46:32.360 --> 00:46:33.500
A friend of your family.

00:46:33.740 --> 00:46:34.040
Hello.

00:46:34.740 --> 00:46:46.280
Do you know who I am?

00:46:46.660 --> 00:46:47.960
I don't remember anyone.

00:46:49.080 --> 00:46:50.820
I don't know you, ma'am.

00:46:50.900 --> 00:46:53.070
Of course you can't know me.

00:46:53.310 --> 00:46:55.270
You were so little when we separated.

00:46:55.710 --> 00:46:58.800
But now we'll be together forever.

00:47:00.060 --> 00:47:02.460
If you leave this school, you'll have a home.

00:47:02.990 --> 00:47:05.820
I don't know what you're talking about. This is my home.

00:47:06.420 --> 00:47:07.620
That's how everyone loves me.

00:47:08.200 --> 00:47:10.540
But that's another love that I already have for you, Lucía.

00:47:10.600 --> 00:47:12.410
A love that you never knew.

00:47:13.030 --> 00:47:18.570
Because I am your mommy, Lucía.

00:47:20.710 --> 00:47:22.590
That's a lie. I don't have a mommy.

00:47:22.830 --> 00:47:24.220
She died when she was a girl.

00:47:24.460 --> 00:47:25.610
Was that true?

00:47:25.920 --> 00:47:27.300
Yes. Dad always told me.

00:47:27.780 --> 00:47:28.920
But he lied to you.

00:47:30.280 --> 00:47:34.010
It's my daughter, Lucia. They've cheated on you.

00:47:34.190 --> 00:47:37.030
Don't say that, ma'am. He never lied to me.

00:47:37.050 --> 00:47:38.290
My mother is dead.

00:47:38.670 --> 00:47:43.600
Come on, ma'am, don't let her go.

00:47:47.080 --> 00:47:47.560
Come on.

00:47:48.740 --> 00:47:50.400
He's right about what he said.

00:47:50.660 --> 00:47:55.020
They made him believe it, ma'am.

00:47:55.020 --> 00:47:56.440
He's different.

00:47:57.080 --> 00:47:58.760
I don't understand why, ma'am.

00:47:58.760 --> 00:47:59.920
I don't know anything.

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:01.240
Can I retire?

00:48:01.580 --> 00:48:03.600
Yes, go away, moron.

00:48:04.020 --> 00:48:04.880
Go away soon.

00:48:09.910 --> 00:48:10.710
It's his fault.

00:48:11.610 --> 00:48:12.510
They've done what they did.

00:48:16.160 --> 00:48:17.100
We'll talk about the will.

00:48:17.720 --> 00:48:19.480
No, not a word of that.

00:48:19.620 --> 00:48:21.050
I don't want that money.

00:48:21.330 --> 00:48:23.870
Are you crazy? It's your money.

00:48:24.260 --> 00:48:24.900
Mine isn't.

00:48:24.940 --> 00:48:29.700
He left his idea to you.

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:35.550
Live always with your faith, so you will never have to be ashamed of me.

00:48:35.850 --> 00:48:38.030
But, will she ever return?

00:48:38.510 --> 00:48:43.330
What a rebellion I have left! I know how to forget about yesterday.

00:48:44.010 --> 00:48:47.510
God has not feared it, nor my destiny.

00:49:11.060 --> 00:49:12.440
What is it?

00:49:14.390 --> 00:49:14.770
Mireya!

00:49:18.010 --> 00:49:18.390
Mireya!

00:49:18.410 --> 00:49:20.550
It seems that they have written it for you, from life to love.

00:49:20.670 --> 00:49:21.270
Leave me alone.

00:49:21.770 --> 00:49:26.620
Listen, it refers to the time of the 90s, but in the end it is as if they had dedicated it to you.

00:49:26.620 --> 00:49:27.880
Even your name has been chosen.

00:49:35.020 --> 00:49:59.940
It was just a coincidence.

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:13.480
I was killed one night for her, and today she is a poor beggar in Piedra.

00:50:13.560 --> 00:50:16.960
Do you remember, brother, how beautiful she was?

00:50:17.380 --> 00:50:20.520
She formed wheels to see her dance.

00:50:21.420 --> 00:50:26.430
When I see you so old, I turn my face.

00:50:30.860 --> 00:50:35.470
Is this the end you have for me?

00:50:36.670 --> 00:50:37.110
Speak!

00:50:37.450 --> 00:50:38.050
No, Mireya.

00:50:38.170 --> 00:50:38.890
Don't be like that.

00:50:39.130 --> 00:50:39.970
You and Mireya are the same.

00:50:40.650 --> 00:50:41.090
Liar.

00:50:41.210 --> 00:50:44.150
You know I'm not going to end up like Mireya.

00:50:44.190 --> 00:50:45.620
I don't know either.

00:50:45.660 --> 00:50:47.070
It doesn't matter.

00:50:47.190 --> 00:50:47.910
Do you understand?

00:50:48.520 --> 00:50:49.380
My life is mine.

00:50:49.680 --> 00:50:51.340
I do whatever I want with it.

00:50:51.360 --> 00:50:52.400
Don't be silly, Mireya.

00:50:52.460 --> 00:50:53.500
Don't listen to tangos.

00:50:53.630 --> 00:50:54.810
I'll always be by your side.

00:50:55.090 --> 00:50:56.510
I don't want anyone by my side.

00:50:56.650 --> 00:50:57.310
Leave me alone.

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:10.970
Lately, you are right, I am like that Mireya, today it still forms wheels to see me dance, tomorrow ...

00:51:11.660 --> 00:51:29.270
The theme of that song obsessed me, it was like a infernal choir that pierced my brain, pointing to a destiny that I did not have the strength to imitate.

00:51:30.350 --> 00:51:34.240
and I looked for oblivion, letting myself be dragged by the whirlwind,

00:51:34.420 --> 00:51:37.390
and I drank large sips of the Cup of Life.

00:51:38.000 --> 00:51:39.800
The Cuppuccini we drank!

00:51:40.200 --> 00:51:41.520
No, for dinner, we are now.

00:51:41.980 --> 00:51:43.100
Manage well, come on!

00:51:43.300 --> 00:51:46.400
As soon as we lift the husband of this, I step forward and watch her.

00:51:46.640 --> 00:51:48.680
No, my husband stands up, eh Alberto?

00:51:49.000 --> 00:51:49.400
For me!

00:51:49.760 --> 00:51:50.660
Be careful of the curve!

00:51:50.920 --> 00:51:51.620
Oh, what a space!

00:51:52.020 --> 00:51:52.220
Alberto!

00:51:52.520 --> 00:51:57.800
My moral collapse, Alberto got tired of me.

00:52:00.760 --> 00:52:05.080
And something that ended with the little courage that I had left to continue living.

00:52:06.290 --> 00:52:08.440
So it's decided, you don't go out to eat with us.

00:52:09.330 --> 00:52:11.300
No, I'm a little dizzy.

00:52:12.040 --> 00:52:16.020
Go to sleep, don't sleep.

00:52:16.480 --> 00:52:18.280
With a whiskey you can do anything.

00:52:18.680 --> 00:52:20.720
Yes, my daughter, how are you going to catch the dream so early?

00:52:21.040 --> 00:52:23.910
Don't worry, I'll take one of these cards.

00:52:25.040 --> 00:52:26.500
Don't abuse those whores here, huh?

00:52:26.540 --> 00:52:27.750
Come with us.

00:52:28.330 --> 00:52:29.510
Thank you.

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:31.600
Ramón, have some fun.

00:52:31.780 --> 00:52:33.860
Yes, well, leave her alone. She wants to go out.

00:52:34.300 --> 00:52:35.020
Let's go, you two.

00:52:35.080 --> 00:52:37.370
See you later, Mireia.

00:52:37.630 --> 00:52:38.270
See you later.

00:52:39.530 --> 00:52:45.720
Hey, don't you kiss her if you want to.

00:52:45.760 --> 00:52:46.640
I'm tired of her.

00:52:47.080 --> 00:52:49.120
She seems to be living in the air for a while.

00:52:49.120 --> 00:52:51.250
It gives me the feeling that she doesn't love me anymore.

00:52:51.510 --> 00:52:53.050
You're not the one who's making fun of me.

00:52:53.090 --> 00:52:56.000
The other night, I saw you in the car with that girl.

00:52:56.220 --> 00:52:56.940
An impulsive man.

00:52:57.300 --> 00:52:58.820
To be serious, you know it.

00:52:59.220 --> 00:52:59.960
Be careful, Ramón.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:01.480
Alberto, because Mireia doesn't deserve it.

00:53:01.540 --> 00:53:02.060
Well, let's eat.

00:53:03.020 --> 00:53:03.840
Take care of the mackerel, okay?

00:53:18.100 --> 00:53:19.520
Don't tell me to go to bed.

00:54:20.760 --> 00:54:22.180
If you keep winning, you can't undo the mess.

00:54:22.620 --> 00:54:25.820
Go to the dormitory, I'm going to say good morning to Mireya and go to sleep right away.

00:54:26.000 --> 00:54:27.910
Good thing we didn't lose the night.

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:30.640
Good morning, Mireia.

00:54:30.740 --> 00:54:32.200
How are you? Is the light on?

00:54:33.120 --> 00:54:36.620
Oh, what luck tonight! Alberto won 5,000!

00:54:36.920 --> 00:54:42.690
Of course, at first it was a little heavy at night, but then, first us.

00:54:43.410 --> 00:54:44.670
Mireia, can you tell me where you are?

00:54:46.900 --> 00:54:48.780
Mireia, tell me!

00:55:00.790 --> 00:55:05.690
Talk to me, talk to me!

00:55:05.750 --> 00:55:08.060
The bottle is empty, but this woman is intoxicated.

00:55:08.240 --> 00:55:09.740
It's not possible, my daughter!

00:55:10.740 --> 00:55:13.210
God willing, it will take time. Call the nurse.

00:55:14.010 --> 00:55:16.810
But the nurse will intervene with the police and...

00:55:16.810 --> 00:55:20.480
Better ask the porter to bring any doctor from the neighborhood.

00:55:20.780 --> 00:55:22.450
Run, Nelly, open the shower.

00:55:22.890 --> 00:55:23.290
Soon.

00:55:43.280 --> 00:55:44.220
Do you want to take her to the sanatorium, doctor?

00:55:44.420 --> 00:55:44.940
Not necessary.

00:55:45.200 --> 00:55:46.410
She will be safe for several hours.

00:55:46.950 --> 00:55:48.720
The heart has reacted well.

00:55:48.920 --> 00:55:51.730
In any case, if you want, I will come later to see how it is.

00:55:52.360 --> 00:55:53.680
We will appreciate it very much, doctor.

00:55:54.110 --> 00:55:56.770
Will the name of the patient complicate the case?

00:55:56.950 --> 00:55:59.380
It will not be in the diaries, doctor.

00:55:59.560 --> 00:55:59.800
I do not know.

00:56:04.370 --> 00:56:09.530
Good morning, sir.

00:56:09.670 --> 00:56:10.410
And your name, doctor?

00:56:10.650 --> 00:56:11.950
Since you have done us this great favor.

00:56:12.450 --> 00:56:12.770
Ponce.

00:56:13.380 --> 00:56:14.060
Carlos Ponce.

00:56:14.120 --> 00:56:15.270
See you later, then.

00:56:15.530 --> 00:56:16.090
Accompany the doctor.

00:56:16.290 --> 00:56:16.730
See you later.

00:56:16.830 --> 00:56:17.590
And thank you, doctor.

00:56:17.910 --> 00:56:28.380
Hearing Mireya's name, he looked at her as if he remembered her.

00:56:28.700 --> 00:56:29.780
This is a well-known last name.

00:56:29.780 --> 00:56:29.960
Mireya.

00:56:30.280 --> 00:56:30.860
It doesn't matter.

00:56:31.600 --> 00:56:33.880
Well, go to sleep, I'll stay here and take care of you.

00:56:34.140 --> 00:56:35.590
No, no, rest your hair.

00:56:36.740 --> 00:56:39.180
I'm guilty of what happened and it's my duty to accompany you.

00:56:39.670 --> 00:56:39.870
Goodbye.

00:56:40.810 --> 00:56:41.750
Don't think about anything.

00:56:41.750 --> 00:56:54.840
I bought it right now.

00:57:10.750 --> 00:57:13.910
Could it be something like a light of redemption?

00:57:15.510 --> 00:57:18.860
Ponce seems to have a lot of money, since he likes the game.

00:57:19.140 --> 00:57:22.200
Would you like to mess with the people of Ten?

00:57:22.680 --> 00:57:24.380
Besides, I feel sorry for that woman.

00:57:24.560 --> 00:57:25.880
She is the one who is looking for a game.

00:57:26.100 --> 00:57:29.350
Since she saved your life two months ago.

00:57:30.280 --> 00:57:32.320
If he attended your convalescence, he won't leave us alone.

00:57:32.900 --> 00:57:37.960
Do you know what I think?

00:57:38.200 --> 00:57:41.190
What man is behind you?

00:57:42.110 --> 00:57:43.760
With that, do I have a guilt?

00:57:44.040 --> 00:57:46.820
If I didn't know you well, I would be afraid of you.

00:57:47.830 --> 00:57:48.830
Don't say nonsense.

00:57:51.730 --> 00:57:53.230
Besides, I notice that you defend him a lot.

00:57:54.040 --> 00:57:56.940
You've never been so worried about a candidate of those who come here.

00:57:57.200 --> 00:57:59.560
What do I care about this man or anyone else?

00:58:00.090 --> 00:58:04.500
You're lying, you care, and you've changed a lot with me a long time ago.

00:58:05.390 --> 00:58:08.320
I'm right, I'm sick of this life.

00:58:08.580 --> 00:58:12.800
At first we were going to get married, but you were always short of money.

00:58:13.080 --> 00:58:19.040
We left it for later, and that's how the years and years have gone by.

00:58:19.040 --> 00:58:23.060
Now I'm ready, I don't want to lose, I feel tired.

00:58:23.540 --> 00:58:25.440
Do you want us to get married?

00:58:27.070 --> 00:58:29.270
It's already late, let's go.

00:58:30.800 --> 00:58:34.820
Our lives are lined up in such a way that it's worth walking now.

00:58:35.330 --> 00:58:37.050
It's that man Mireya, I guess.

00:58:37.370 --> 00:58:39.090
But I swear I'm not going to have her.

00:58:39.740 --> 00:58:40.960
I'll use all my resources.

00:58:41.480 --> 00:58:43.020
She'll regret meeting you.

00:58:43.540 --> 00:58:45.500
I'm not going to intervene like other people.

00:58:46.220 --> 00:58:50.120
No smiles, no tricks, no cups for Mariano.

00:58:50.850 --> 00:58:52.750
I don't want to help you get rid of him.

00:58:52.890 --> 00:58:54.370
See? And you're selling yourself.

00:58:55.170 --> 00:58:56.970
And you're interested in that guy even if you don't want to confess.

00:58:57.310 --> 00:58:58.820
You can think what you want.

00:58:59.250 --> 00:58:59.910
While you...

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:02.700
No, you will stay here and witness everything.

00:59:02.880 --> 00:59:05.880
I want him to know that you are my accomplice, as you have been for so many years.

00:59:07.250 --> 00:59:07.690
Ah, yes.

00:59:16.530 --> 00:59:18.820
Ponce, how are you doing, boys?

00:59:19.220 --> 00:59:20.160
Are you preparing a soup?

00:59:20.420 --> 00:59:21.640
Well, I'm going to serve you some whisky.

00:59:21.900 --> 00:59:22.940
How are you, Maria?

00:59:23.140 --> 00:59:26.050
A short game because my friend Ponce has to do it.

00:59:26.840 --> 00:59:28.260
We start whenever you want.

00:59:29.110 --> 00:59:29.370
Mireia.

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:33.700
I have a headache. I'll go to the terrace for a moment.

00:59:33.760 --> 00:59:36.300
If you don't mind, I'll go with you while the friends prepare everything.

00:59:36.860 --> 00:59:38.940
I don't mind. Just go.

00:59:39.260 --> 00:59:40.810
If she wants...

00:59:40.870 --> 00:59:41.470
Shut up.

00:59:41.770 --> 00:59:45.300
You look a little nervous. What's wrong with you?

00:59:45.940 --> 00:59:49.000
It's because the boy likes Mireia and you care about her.

00:59:49.040 --> 00:59:50.040
You know she adores you.

00:59:50.120 --> 00:59:50.680
The better man.

00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:53.220
The more a candidate is, the less she pays the bills.

00:59:53.700 --> 00:59:55.640
You want to shut up? How can you talk like that?

00:59:56.220 --> 00:59:57.880
You don't know what Mireia means to me.

01:00:00.570 --> 01:00:03.670
She is all my youth, all my life.

01:00:03.790 --> 01:00:06.580
What? Are you going to put romance to good work?

01:00:06.840 --> 01:00:09.260
What do you say to me? I've never seen you like that, brother.

01:00:10.240 --> 01:00:14.820
You're right, I'm sorry. I know what happens to me in this part of time.

01:00:15.570 --> 01:00:16.610
It must be that I'm getting old.

01:00:16.990 --> 01:00:17.710
Don't say that.

01:00:17.990 --> 01:00:20.330
Give me a whiskey, please. I'll take care of it.

01:00:20.710 --> 01:00:21.670
I'll bring it right away.

01:00:21.870 --> 01:00:28.940
No, not me, Ana María. Everything you've told me since we met, life has no end.

01:00:31.020 --> 01:00:33.560
Why do you worry so much about a woman like you?

01:00:33.900 --> 01:00:35.940
No, she's a victim of her own.

01:00:36.060 --> 01:00:39.270
And I've always lacked a firm and honest hand to guide her.

01:00:40.940 --> 01:00:44.910
Why can't I be the one to take care of her, Ana María?

01:00:48.200 --> 01:00:51.880
How can I believe you know something about my life?

01:00:51.980 --> 01:00:56.260
The doctor is here today.

01:00:56.300 --> 01:00:59.410
Playing is what I think, but it's not like that.

01:01:00.510 --> 01:01:04.300
I'm here because I'm going to tell you what you should be sure of.

01:01:04.300 --> 01:01:08.890
But I should tell you.

01:01:09.110 --> 01:01:10.980
Is everything ready?

01:01:11.340 --> 01:01:11.920
When you like.

01:01:12.680 --> 01:01:20.960
Sit down.

01:01:21.320 --> 01:01:21.980
Thank you.

01:01:21.980 --> 01:01:23.430
We open the boxes or you open them?

01:01:23.750 --> 01:01:24.690
No, you open them.

01:01:24.870 --> 01:01:26.920
No, thank you very much.

01:01:26.980 --> 01:01:27.680
You know I'll see you later.

01:01:27.800 --> 01:01:29.400
We start cheap, you know.

01:01:29.500 --> 01:01:29.840
We make boxes.

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:31.000
It's a 200-peso box.

01:01:31.040 --> 01:01:32.720
Hey, I can't see a thing.

01:01:32.920 --> 01:01:33.540
Let me.

01:01:33.930 --> 01:01:34.250
Come on.

01:01:34.410 --> 01:01:35.570
Give me another one.

01:01:48.860 --> 01:01:51.810
You didn't do it on purpose, Mica.

01:01:51.870 --> 01:01:53.920
Because if you do, they'll kill me and we'll lose the point.

01:01:54.410 --> 01:01:56.660
Please, let me.

01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:01.180
I hope you're lucky, my friend.

01:02:01.260 --> 01:02:01.760
Me too.

01:02:01.980 --> 01:02:03.520
Yes, for this man.

01:02:04.670 --> 01:02:11.710
For you.

01:02:11.870 --> 01:02:13.140
For me.

01:02:13.260 --> 01:02:13.500
Good.

01:02:19.120 --> 01:02:19.400
500.

01:02:23.900 --> 01:02:24.320
Valued, huh?

01:02:24.420 --> 01:02:26.740
I'm afraid.

01:02:26.940 --> 01:02:27.850
I just don't like it.

01:02:28.730 --> 01:02:29.110
Besides...

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:37.550
I already lose more than I thought, when you come to play, you don't think about the loss, now you come to something else.

01:02:37.950 --> 01:02:38.310
Gonzalves.

01:02:38.470 --> 01:02:39.630
Do you want another whiskey?

01:02:39.950 --> 01:02:43.320
Take the friend, Tom. Nobody is going to take advantage of me.

01:02:43.320 --> 01:02:44.160
I don't like drinking.

01:02:44.480 --> 01:02:47.010
Well, play without fear, Tom. I open with 500.

01:02:47.360 --> 01:02:48.720
Ah, so you can see that I don't have.

01:02:49.070 --> 01:02:49.750
500 more.

01:02:50.210 --> 01:02:50.690
Ah, 1000.

01:02:50.910 --> 01:02:54.110
No, don't play anymore, Ponce.

01:02:54.310 --> 01:02:54.890
What are you saying?

01:02:55.230 --> 01:02:59.340
I don't care what happens to me, but I must say it, they are stealing it.

01:02:59.480 --> 01:02:59.960
Are you crazy?

01:03:00.080 --> 01:03:00.720
Mireya!

01:03:00.940 --> 01:03:03.040
She's funny, but don't listen to her!

01:03:03.080 --> 01:03:04.240
Go away from this house!

01:03:04.520 --> 01:03:05.340
She's a thief!

01:03:05.940 --> 01:03:08.360
She's been here for many years and I've kept quiet.

01:03:08.600 --> 01:03:10.970
But I don't want you to rob her!

01:03:11.130 --> 01:03:13.780
So I was right!

01:03:14.480 --> 01:03:16.580
You're not going to touch this woman, at least.

01:03:16.820 --> 01:03:18.790
Who are you to stop me?

01:03:19.140 --> 01:03:19.880
A simple friend.

01:03:20.440 --> 01:03:22.220
She's come to this house to take away Mireya from me.

01:03:22.300 --> 01:03:23.580
Not with the interest that you assume.

01:03:24.460 --> 01:03:25.620
That's what scoundrels do.

01:03:25.750 --> 01:03:26.570
How dare you!

01:03:27.050 --> 01:03:27.230
Come here!

01:03:27.630 --> 01:03:28.710
You won't do that.

01:03:34.700 --> 01:03:37.340
Don't make me forget what you did for me.

01:03:37.440 --> 01:03:38.280
Don't lie, kid.

01:03:38.860 --> 01:03:39.820
Come on, get in the van.

01:03:40.100 --> 01:03:41.640
No, I didn't bring any weapons.

01:03:41.680 --> 01:03:42.440
I came here, bitch.

01:03:42.880 --> 01:03:45.140
Don't think I've come here in a daze like so many idiots.

01:03:45.400 --> 01:03:47.390
I came knowing what was waiting for me.

01:03:47.470 --> 01:03:54.350
I just wanted to see if Ana Maria was the woman I imagined or if I was wrong.

01:03:54.650 --> 01:03:57.690
If she's willing, she'll change her life from now on.

01:03:57.710 --> 01:03:59.980
Leave this house to Ana Maria.

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:04.070
Yes, I want to. When I spoke just now, I was determined to go.

01:04:04.470 --> 01:04:06.420
Mireia, don't leave me now.

01:04:06.760 --> 01:04:12.060
One day I had to go. I'm not anymore.

01:04:13.310 --> 01:04:18.010
Come out with me. I'll leave you at a hotel and from tomorrow you'll have a job to take care of.

01:04:18.150 --> 01:04:20.040
Are you going to kiss me?

01:04:20.280 --> 01:04:21.900
Wait until tomorrow, think about it.

01:04:22.120 --> 01:04:25.420
No, if you don't leave today, you'll never leave. Let's go.

01:04:25.580 --> 01:04:26.910
Do you want me to bring you a drink?

01:04:27.170 --> 01:04:28.970
You don't owe me anything. Let's go.

01:04:45.520 --> 01:04:47.400
I have this one that interests me and I'm going to hit myself.

01:04:47.660 --> 01:04:56.640
You didn't do it either.

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:07.880
Shame on you, you're dead and we'll give you a drink for your death.

01:05:20.790 --> 01:05:25.320
Well, well, let's drink, it's better here.

01:05:25.860 --> 01:05:27.520
Dr. Ponce likes us if we drink.

01:05:27.940 --> 01:05:29.500
It's strange that he hasn't come yet.

01:05:30.700 --> 01:05:38.880
You come so little and you are always in a hurry, but you are so good here and you respect her so much, there she is, open Emilia.

01:05:39.040 --> 01:05:52.910
I've been looking for you for a month like crazy, how are you? How are you?

01:05:53.880 --> 01:05:59.960
Come, come, let's go Emilia, come sit down, I have so much to tell you.

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:01.500
There are so many things I have to tell you, tell me!

01:06:02.120 --> 01:06:04.240
Please, I beg you, don't talk to me like that.

01:06:04.580 --> 01:06:06.300
What do you mean like that? I want to talk to you from the beginning.

01:06:06.900 --> 01:06:08.890
Tell me, are you Teresa Ponce?

01:06:09.090 --> 01:06:12.400
Tell me, tell me, tell me.

01:06:12.570 --> 01:06:13.510
What's going on between you two?

01:06:14.530 --> 01:06:18.290
Nothing, I swear. He's a very good man.

01:06:18.490 --> 01:06:20.530
He takes care of me, he doesn't miss a thing.

01:06:20.610 --> 01:06:23.380
More than affection, he appreciates what I feel.

01:06:24.560 --> 01:06:26.100
What are you thinking about starting a restaurant,

01:06:26.860 --> 01:06:28.400
an office, a fashion house, anywhere?

01:06:30.120 --> 01:06:32.740
So, we'll never talk to you?

01:06:33.580 --> 01:06:35.980
We'll never talk to you.

01:06:36.000 --> 01:06:36.320
Better.

01:06:36.660 --> 01:06:38.470
That way you won't mind what I'm going to tell you.

01:06:38.530 --> 01:06:41.110
You know that I'm your friend and I don't want to give you a bad time, eh?

01:06:41.230 --> 01:06:43.710
But what's going on? Has something happened to him?

01:06:43.930 --> 01:06:46.390
No, but it's about to happen. He's going to marry you next month.

01:06:46.670 --> 01:06:48.020
What? What are you saying?

01:06:48.160 --> 01:06:49.030
Are you serious?

01:06:49.650 --> 01:06:51.130
We've followed the steps with Lloveras.

01:06:51.150 --> 01:06:52.730
He's dating a girl with a lot of money.

01:06:52.830 --> 01:06:53.790
A whore, you know?

01:06:53.950 --> 01:06:55.280
He could have taken your hair.

01:06:55.380 --> 01:06:56.960
By saying that he doesn't even call himself Ponce.

01:06:57.680 --> 01:06:59.480
Call himself Ponce.

01:07:01.980 --> 01:07:04.680
It's the son of your old lawyer, Dr. Medina.

01:07:04.820 --> 01:07:07.270
Well, for the son, the son must know your whole life.

01:07:07.550 --> 01:07:09.360
He only died on the night of the trial.

01:07:09.620 --> 01:07:13.640
And why? My God, what did he look for me?

01:07:13.700 --> 01:07:17.180
I don't know, let's see what men are like.

01:07:17.220 --> 01:07:19.540
Alberto would be angry at him. He wanted to laugh at you.

01:07:19.780 --> 01:07:21.680
But why didn't he like his commitment?

01:07:22.080 --> 01:07:22.280
Why?

01:07:22.930 --> 01:07:23.890
I'm going to explain why.

01:07:24.210 --> 01:07:25.650
They've been together for a year.

01:07:25.670 --> 01:07:26.490
It's her home.

01:07:26.990 --> 01:07:28.930
I even brought you his address in case you need it.

01:07:30.350 --> 01:07:32.370
That sister of your late father. They say she's very pretty.

01:07:32.430 --> 01:07:32.770
Enough!

01:07:33.070 --> 01:07:35.040
Please, leave me alone.

01:07:35.140 --> 01:07:35.860
Now I want more!

01:07:38.790 --> 01:07:48.040
I don't want anything!

01:08:30.090 --> 01:08:31.850
I'm sure she's the one who wants to see that lady.

01:08:32.190 --> 01:08:33.430
No, she wants to see you. I promised her.

01:08:34.110 --> 01:08:34.930
Do you know me?

01:08:35.310 --> 01:08:36.770
No, she says she doesn't even know your name.

01:08:37.350 --> 01:08:39.480
She's a strange woman. She seems nervous.

01:08:39.960 --> 01:08:40.840
Didn't you give her your card?

01:08:41.140 --> 01:08:42.700
I'm sure you don't know her either.

01:08:42.800 --> 01:08:45.350
She wanted to see you for a charity project, she told me.

01:08:45.570 --> 01:08:46.300
Of course.

01:08:46.600 --> 01:08:49.170
Well, make her wait in the living room. I'll be right down.

01:08:49.470 --> 01:08:53.680
Have a seat, ma'am.

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:33.530
How will you understand me if you have never suffered?

01:09:34.240 --> 01:09:37.500
God has given you wealth, happiness, a man who loves you.

01:09:37.640 --> 01:09:39.830
A trait, he denied it to me.

01:09:46.500 --> 01:09:48.310
Narapo, I had no salvation.

01:09:48.690 --> 01:09:51.660
And one day a man crossed my path in this that he gave me,

01:09:51.660 --> 01:09:55.120
not love, but a little illusion,

01:09:55.500 --> 01:09:58.450
enough to want to be what I was going to be,

01:09:58.650 --> 01:09:59.590
a good woman.

01:10:00.640 --> 01:10:04.480
I don't want you to steal from me that poor piece of happiness that I owe you.

01:10:04.890 --> 01:10:05.310
Do you understand?

01:10:06.170 --> 01:10:08.690
You mean Carlos, without a doubt?

01:10:08.850 --> 01:10:10.640
Yes, I mean him.

01:10:10.640 --> 01:10:12.460
It's a mistake I'm making.

01:10:12.980 --> 01:10:15.480
Because if I love you, I won't be able to change your feelings.

01:10:15.900 --> 01:10:18.780
But once I even have to oppose my destiny.

01:10:19.160 --> 01:10:22.480
That man won't be mine, but he won't be yours either.

01:10:23.070 --> 01:10:26.590
You'll have beauty, youth, money, whatever you want.

01:10:26.850 --> 01:10:29.890
But you'll never have Carlos, because before...

01:10:30.280 --> 01:10:32.280
I killed mom.

01:10:32.520 --> 01:10:37.280
Open up.

01:10:38.480 --> 01:10:38.960
Yes, mom.

01:10:39.160 --> 01:10:41.160
My dear mom.

01:10:42.160 --> 01:10:43.380
Don't you remember me?

01:10:43.620 --> 01:10:43.780
Who?

01:10:49.800 --> 01:10:53.400
Who are you?

01:10:54.690 --> 01:10:59.510
I'm that stupid boy who once told you his mother loved you.

01:11:00.800 --> 01:11:04.900
You, then, did you know that I...

01:11:04.900 --> 01:11:09.320
The man who held your hand, that good man you know, told me your story, mom.

01:11:09.560 --> 01:11:12.400
He taught me to love you and took you away from the environment in which you lived,

01:11:12.520 --> 01:11:14.480
without another object than the one of approaching me.

01:11:15.370 --> 01:11:17.900
But, then, he didn't tell me.

01:11:18.120 --> 01:11:21.660
I made a mistake. I didn't realize your spiritual purity.

01:11:21.980 --> 01:11:23.700
You wanted to cling to an illusion.

01:11:24.060 --> 01:11:27.210
You also wanted to know that you hated your daughter.

01:11:28.340 --> 01:11:28.720
She didn't tell you.

01:11:30.060 --> 01:11:33.730
If I hated my daughter, I would have known that she...

01:11:33.730 --> 01:11:36.740
My dear mother, forgive me.

01:11:36.900 --> 01:11:42.860
A radiant happiness, my child.

01:11:43.100 --> 01:11:44.760
Imagine, dad, everything solved.

01:11:45.530 --> 01:11:47.770
Chia and her mother are so happy with such a happy man.

01:11:47.830 --> 01:11:49.700
Why doesn't Ana Maria declare the truth?

01:11:49.940 --> 01:11:52.520
She should be the godmother instead of the aunt of her husband.

01:11:52.790 --> 01:11:53.930
We couldn't convince her.

01:11:54.420 --> 01:11:57.130
She fears people. She wants to be like a relative of hers.

01:11:57.270 --> 01:11:58.530
Come here.

01:12:03.390 --> 01:12:05.940
I'm going to put some wine for the bride and for the church.

01:12:06.280 --> 01:12:07.040
We're all going.

01:12:07.100 --> 01:12:07.380
Great.

01:12:09.490 --> 01:12:09.990
So, Carlos.

01:12:10.130 --> 01:12:11.400
Yes, I already know that woman.

01:12:15.620 --> 01:12:15.940
Liar.

01:12:16.060 --> 01:12:18.590
They must have cut off his balls.

01:12:19.820 --> 01:12:20.260
You'll see.

01:12:30.960 --> 01:12:33.880
My wife is a friend of the one I've been with for a few years.

01:12:34.020 --> 01:12:34.220
No.

01:12:36.200 --> 01:12:38.710
Don't be so mean. I've never liked him.

01:12:39.550 --> 01:12:43.890
You're going to see.

01:12:44.210 --> 01:12:44.770
Shut up.

01:13:00.190 --> 01:13:02.250
You can be very proud, Carlos, of yourself.

01:13:02.600 --> 01:13:04.000
Can you leave us alone for a moment, please?

01:13:04.380 --> 01:13:05.260
I'll call you right away.

01:13:07.080 --> 01:13:09.460
Mom, there's something that bothers me about this day.

01:13:09.660 --> 01:13:12.110
Why don't you want the guests to know who you are?

01:13:12.270 --> 01:13:14.640
They'll find out later, little girl.

01:13:15.250 --> 01:13:17.720
For the moment, leave them to think I'm a fool.

01:13:18.100 --> 01:13:20.750
There's something strange in this mystery that you want to keep.

01:13:21.110 --> 01:13:23.270
And it hurts me that you didn't want to be the godmother.

01:13:23.490 --> 01:13:25.280
Wouldn't you like to be with me?

01:13:25.380 --> 01:13:27.320
In the same church where you got married?

01:13:27.740 --> 01:13:29.920
I don't think so, Juventus. I'll attend the...

01:13:30.880 --> 01:13:33.360
And I'll be as happy as if I were by your side.

01:13:33.480 --> 01:13:34.660
But one day they'll have to know.

01:13:35.120 --> 01:13:36.360
I want them to know.

01:13:36.560 --> 01:13:37.980
I'm not ashamed of you.

01:13:38.200 --> 01:13:41.240
Why make people's comments now?

01:13:41.700 --> 01:13:43.420
They'd imagine so many things.

01:13:43.640 --> 01:13:45.180
They'd dig into my past.

01:13:45.440 --> 01:13:47.610
And that could hurt you.

01:13:47.770 --> 01:13:49.570
I don't care what they think or say, mom.

01:13:50.300 --> 01:13:52.220
Well, when you come back from your wedding day,

01:13:52.340 --> 01:13:54.460
we'll live together and we'll tell the truth.

01:13:54.700 --> 01:13:56.660
If you wish so.

01:13:57.180 --> 01:13:57.600
Enough.

01:13:58.390 --> 01:13:59.650
Don't make me sad.

01:14:26.650 --> 01:14:27.170
to achieve their goals.

01:14:45.680 --> 01:14:50.200
It is enough to know that you will be very happy.

01:14:51.020 --> 01:14:54.000
I do not want you to be ashamed someday of what I am.

01:14:54.520 --> 01:14:55.460
There they get in the car.

01:15:30.090 --> 01:15:30.490
What are you waiting for?

01:15:30.730 --> 01:15:33.410
They got caught again.

01:15:33.570 --> 01:15:33.990
What's going on?

01:15:35.900 --> 01:15:36.460
Let's see, let's see.

01:15:49.390 --> 01:15:50.450
And soon Europe, guys.

01:15:50.670 --> 01:15:52.210
Paris is expected to be like the year 18.

01:15:52.470 --> 01:15:53.530
Don't be silly, Llovera.

01:15:53.530 --> 01:15:54.880
Our era is over.

01:15:55.060 --> 01:15:57.070
It's been 20 years.

01:15:57.210 --> 01:15:59.360
20 years.

01:16:00.860 --> 01:16:02.940
another generation and other customs.

01:16:03.760 --> 01:16:06.120
Now the only thing we owe to God

01:16:06.680 --> 01:16:08.540
is to live peacefully in our home.

01:16:09.340 --> 01:16:09.860
You're right.

01:16:10.320 --> 01:16:12.580
I almost forget my age and start singing

01:16:12.580 --> 01:16:14.120
the Piperari like that day.

01:16:14.360 --> 01:16:14.980
Do you remember?

01:16:15.540 --> 01:16:17.630
It seems that we are four mummies,

01:16:17.710 --> 01:16:19.150
a little girl still.

01:16:19.630 --> 01:16:20.220
Let's go.

01:16:30.124 --> 01:16:30.624
Hello?

01:16:30.668 --> 01:16:34.668
What are you looking at? You look like you escaped from the museum in Lujan.

01:16:34.668 --> 01:16:36.668
Don't get me involved anymore. Walk.
